  "Posted 'Leia's Quarters' dested Cloud City: Guest Quarters (the Cloud City site where Leia stayed; the objective deploys one Cloud City battleground site); 'Keeping the Empire Out' dested Keeping The Empire Out Forever; 'Your Insights Serve you (Usually)' dested Your Insight Serves You Well.",
  "Posted 'Cloud City' dested Bespin: Cloud City; 'EPP Luke/Obi Wan/Leia' dested Luke With Lightsaber, Obi-Wan With Lightsaber and Leia With Blaster Rifle; 'Wedge RSL' Wedge Antilles, Red Squadron Leader; 'Elyk Rhue' Elyhek Rue; 'Pucimer Thryss' Pucumir Thryss; 'Lando w/ Blaster' Lando With Blaster Pistol.",
